WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.163
Welcome to the Red Team Scribe orientation.

00:00:03.163 --> 00:00:06.800
Own Red Team's written decision record, preserve its rationale

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.175
, and hand complete work across the explicit review boundary

00:00:10.175 --> 00:00:10.338
.

00:00:10.338 --> 00:00:13.450
Your workflow moves from listening, to structured drafting,

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.225
to an explicit handoff.

00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:18.650
Use each surface to preserve the team’s intent, evidence

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.938
, assumptions, and rationale.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:23.825
A record is not handed off merely because another role

00:00:23.825 --> 00:00:24.775
can see it;

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:28.125
confirm the documented workflow state before you move on.
